      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Today I had this issue occur on two accounts at the same time. I had both accounts logged in watching a movie in the same instance. Suddenly both accounts experienced a network issue saying they were disconnected for an unknown reason, with a reconnect button. No one else in the instance experienced this problem. Upon rejoining the instance, the popup was there. One account is logged in Desktop. The other account is in VR. The popup will re-appear in front of the screen every time the menu is opened. The popup will not disappear when the menu is closed. In both desktop and VR mode, the popup will stick in the place where the menu was opened. Meaning I can open the menu, then just move away from the popup so that it's out of view. The popup render over everything else.The popup will also render in the VRchat camera when UI is turned on in masks.  The screenshots show both VR and desktop behavior",
